(1) 177th Report on Action Taken by the Government on the recommendations contained in the One-Hundred Sixty-Second Report of the Committee on Drugs & Pharmaceuticals Research Programme including herbal medicines; 

(2) 178th Report on Action Taken by the Government on the recommendations contained in the One Hundred Seventieth Report of the Committee on the Demands for Grants (2007-08) of the Department of Science & Technology; 

